   "was": "\"CRIMSON HEXAGON / NH-OS DOI REGISTRY v7.0  Complete Document\" is a structured dataset in the Crimson Hexagonal Archive, compiled by Lee Sharks · Johannes Sigil · Rex Fraction (2026-03-16). Complete Document Archive with Enrichment Layers — March 2026. The work comprises 20,022 words and is classifi",
   "now": "Version 7.0 of the Crimson Hexagon / NH-OS DOI Registry, recording the archive’s March 2026 state as 387 active DOI records and 2,851 typed relation edges. Unlike the navigation maps, which model traversal and semantic gravity, the registry supplies the enumerated historical inventory.\n\nThis version adds five enrichment layers: one-line précis for 348 records, a relation graph, subsystem classification, document-type taxonomy, and provenance-gravity tiers. It also records 39 zero-edge orphans, distribution across 19 subsystems, the top inbound citation anchors, heteronym attribution, and 134 records added since v6.0."
